OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween lovers build spooky
OL,4,Agarden graveyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have created a spooky
OL,7,FHalloween scene outside their home
OL,8,Fusing handmade decorations after
OL,9,Fspending about two months building the
OL,10,Fattraction.
OL,12,FNico Slatter and Ashleigh Feveyear have
OL,13,Ftransformed their garden in Hempstead,
OL,14,Fnear Gillingham, with props including
OL,15,Fgravestones, sound effects, smoke and
OL,16,Fanimated figures.
OL,18,FThe graveyard they have created in
OL,19,FBirch Grove uses headstones that were
OL,20,Fmade out of polystyrene by Nico, and
OL,21,Fthen painted by Ashleigh.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
