OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween lovers build spooky
OL,4,Agarden graveyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshleigh said: "It was fun. I mean, it
OL,7,Fgave us something to do over two
OL,8,Fmonths, basically, and we did it
OL,9,Fbecause we just really enjoy creating
OL,10,Fstuff and we like spooky and we like
OL,11,FHalloween. So it just all kind of made
OL,12,Fsense."
